1
00:00:00,415 --> 00:00:03,245
(Sheldon:)Well, this box only covers
my work through nursery school.

2
00:00:03,418 --> 00:00:07,078
(Sheldon:)There's a good deal more to come.
I didn't really hit my academic stride...

3
00:00:07,255 --> 00:00:10,745
(Sheldon:)...until I cut out that time-suck
known as playing outdoors.

4
00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:14,920
You're gonna spend hours and hours
combing through all this stuff?

5
00:00:15,096 --> 00:00:18,086
(Sheldon:)That's a good point.
My time is much too valuable.

6
00:00:18,266 --> 00:00:20,596
(Sheldon:)Perhaps I should find someone
to do it for me.

7
00:00:20,769 --> 00:00:23,329
(Sheldon:)Someone with a rudimentary
understanding of science...

8
00:00:23,538 --> 00:00:27,338
(Sheldon:)...but whose real talents lie
in menial labor.

9
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:33,550
- Not gonna happen.
- Yeah, well...

10
00:00:34,082 --> 00:00:37,412
(Sheldon:)If I didn't think you could handle it,
I wouldn't be asking.

11
00:00:38,153 --> 00:00:40,183
(Leonard:)If you want help, just hire a grad student.

12
00:00:40,355 --> 00:00:43,155
- Maybe I could do it.
- Really.

13
00:00:44,292 --> 00:00:48,192
(Sheldon:)You can assess the quality of my work?
Okay. Um, here.

14
00:00:48,363 --> 00:00:50,563
I wrote this when I was 5 years old.

15
00:00:51,466 --> 00:00:53,296
"A proof that algebraic topology...

16
00:00:53,468 --> 00:00:58,598
...can never have a non-self-contradictory
set of abelian groups."

17
00:01:02,777 --> 00:01:05,867
I'm just a blond monkey to you,
aren't I?

18
00:01:09,017 --> 00:01:12,027
(Sheldon:)You said it, not me.

